cash","chapter":"Cult.fit + Codex","from":2335,"to":2423},{"say":"One engineer rebuilt a dashboard that cost over a hundred thousand dollars a year… in a weekend.","visual":{"type":"number","value":100000,"prefix":"$","suffix":"+","label":"dashboard rebuilt in a weekend","image":"real:cultfit-og.png"},"sfx":"cash","chapter":"Cult.fit + Codex","from":2423,"to":2571},{"say":"Customer support costs dropped more than fifty percent; about twenty percent of gym users already use the voice AI Trainer.","visual":{"type":"scale","title":"Cult.fit results","shape":"bar","items":[{"value":50,"display":">50%","label":"support cost cut"},{"value":20,"display":"~20%","label":"voice trainer users"}],"caption":"OpenAI · cult.fit"},"chapter":"Cult.fit + Codex","from":2571,"to":2760},{"say":"The rollout was a hackathon, executive training, twice-weekly office hours, and engineers embedded in other teams.","visual":{"type":"terminal","lines":["$ cultfit adopt --tool codex","> hackathon ✓","> exec training ✓","> office hours ×2 / week ✓","> embed engineers → HR · ops · support"]},"sfx":"typing","chapter":"Cult.fit + Codex","from":2760,"to":2942},{"say":"Adoption still needs people. The old-fashioned part of the rollout.","visual":{"type":"gif","gif":"gif:parks-wow","caption":"people still required","credit":"via GIPHY","iw":470,"ih":376},"chapter":"Cult.fit + Codex","from":2942,"to":3047},{"chapter":"BioBasicsBench","say":"OpenAI and Ligo put agents through BioBasicsBench: one hundred routine wet-lab tasks.","visual":{"type":"story","headline":"Measuring agents on wet-lab science","source":"OpenAI · Ligo","image":"real:biobasics-story.png","highlight":"BioBasicsBench"},"sfx":"whoosh","from":3047,"to":3207},{"say":"Gels, plates, microscopy, sequences, videos, instrument readings — and admitting when evidence is missing.","visual":{"type":"sequence","title":"100 wet-lab tasks","items":[{"image":"real:biobasics-story.png","caption":"gels · plates"},{"image":"real:biobasics-page.png","caption":"microscopy"},{"image":"real:logo-openai.svg","caption":"admit gaps"}]},"chapter":"BioBasicsBench","from":3207,"to":3404},{"say":"G P T six Astra scores sixty-six point seven percent; G P T five point six Sol, forty-three point eight.","visual":{"type":"scale","title":"BioBasicsBench credit","shape":"circle","items":[{"value":66.7,"display":"66.7%","label":"GPT-6 Astra"},{"value":43.8,"display":"43.8%","label":"GPT-5.6 Sol"}],"caption":"OpenAI · Ligo · 18,500 results"},"sfx":"ding","chapter":"BioBasicsBench","from":3404,"to":3595},{"say":"Eighteen thousand five hundred scored results reward concrete decisions, not answers that merely sound like a lab coat.","visual":{"type":"number","value":18500,"label":"scored results","image":"real:biobasics-story.png"},"chapter":"BioBasicsBench","from":3595,"to":3769},{"chapter":"Axiom · Lean","say":"In other news, Axiom translates the Stacks Project into computer-checked Lean.","visual":{"type":"story","headline":"Axiom keeps AI slop out of math","source":"TechCrunch · Nov 5, 2026","image":"real:axiom-tc.jpg","highlight":"Axiom"},"sfx":"whoosh","from":3769,"to":3900},{"say":"Seven thousand six hundred fifty-four pages become nearly sixteen million lines of Lean, reviewable line by line.","visual":{"type":"scale","title":"Stacks → Lean","shape":"circle","items":[{"value":7654,"display":"7,654","label":"pages"},{"value":16000000,"display":"~16M","label":"Lean lines"}],"caption":"Axiom · Stacks Project"},"sfx":"pop","chapter":"Axiom · Lean","from":3900,"to":4092},{"say":"They also formalize the classification of finite simple groups — about fifteen thousand pages of original proof, the enormous theorem.","visual":{"type":"image","image":"real:axiom-cfsg.png","motion":"zoom","focus":[0.15,0.15,0.7,0.7],"caption":"CFSG · Enormous Theorem","iw":1200,"ih":1200},"chapter":"Axiom · Lean","from":4092,"to":4337},{"say":"Every step must pass a checker that cannot be seduced by prose.","visual":{"type":"logo","name":"Axiom","sub":"Lean · no AI slop"},"chapter":"Axiom · Lean","from":4337,"to":4449},{"chapter":"Perplexity Max","say":"Perplexity launches Teammates: persistent agents that take work from Slack.","visual":{"type":"story","headline":"Perplexity Teammates","source":"Perplexity","image":"real:perplexity-teammate.png","highlight":"Teammates"},"sfx":"whoosh","from":4449,"to":4579},{"say":"The agent keeps a role, joins a channel, and follows up with Projects, Skills, and Memory.","visual":{"type":"callouts","image":"real:perplexity-teammate.png","title":"Teammate stack","points":[{"at":[0.35,0.35],"label":"Slack","sub":"channel work","side":"left"},{"at":[0.55,0.5],"label":"Projects","sub":"ongoing","side":"right"},{"at":[0.65,0.7],"label":"Memory","sub":"role persists","side":"right"}],"iw":1440,"ih":900},"chapter":"Perplexity Max","from":4579,"to":4725},{"say":"Available on the web for the Max plan at two hundred dollars a month.","visual":{"type":"number","value":200,"prefix":"$","suffix":"/mo","label":"Perplexity Max · Teammates","image":"real:perplexity-teammate.png"},"sfx":"cash","chapter":"Perplexity Max","from":4725,"to":4819},{"say":"The artificial coworker starts looking less like a chat and more like a user account that never drops pending tasks.","visual":{"type":"versus","left":"Chat prompt","right":"Persistent role","leftImage":"real:logo-perplexity.svg","rightImage":"real:logo-slack.svg","verdict":"Teammates"},"chapter":"Perplexity Max","from":4819,"to":5000},{"say":"This has been Distilled, thanks for watching, and I will see you tomorrow.","visual":{"type":"logo","name":"Distilled","sub":"see you tomorrow"},"chapter":"Perplexity Max","from":5000,"to":5120}],"theme":"amber-paper"}